s/862703457198327/</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11618-christopherzacher","name":"ChristopherZacher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11618_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"631"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-15T08:18:58-07:00","id":1335897,"title":"","content":"Hello folks,<br /> <br /> We bring to you the 4<sup>th</sup> chapter of our Chronicles of Darkness: Inferno story \u201cTemptation\u201d. We hope you enjoy!<br /> <br /> A letter is drafted, and a homeless veteran is shown kindness. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://twincitiebynight.podbean.com/e/episode-323-chronicles-of-darkness-inferno-temptation-chapter-4/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://d2bwo9zemjwxh5.cloudfront.net/ep-logo/pbblog4577585/Temptation_SC_1200x628.jpg?s=23e94e5ac1c85a02bb86ebfa89402dc6&amp;e=jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://twincitiebynight.podbean.com/e/episode-323-chronicles-of-darkness-inferno-temptation-chapter-4/\" target=\"_blank\"> Chronicles of Darkness: Inferno \"Temptation\" Chapter 4: Cartel of Defiance | Twin Cities by Night </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://twincitiebynight.podbean.com/e/episode-323-chronicles-of-darkness-inferno-temptation-chapter-4/\" target=\"_blank\"> https://twincitiebynight.podbean.com/e/episode-323-chronicles-of-darkness-inferno-temptation-chapter-4/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> In the holy city of T&aacute;bor, conviction and consequence begin to entwine. As faith collides with fear and authority, both Brother Jan and Sir Reinhard find themselves standing at the edge of revelation &mdash; each guided by unseen hands toward choices that will shape not only their souls, but the world around them. What begins as devotion soon becomes something far more perilous. About the Chronicle Chronicles of Darkness: Inferno &ndash; &ldquo;Temptation&rdquo; is a dark historical chronicle set amid the fires of the Hussite Wars. Guided by Slavik as Storyteller, it explores the fragile line between faith and damnation, where every prayer carries the risk of summoning something that listens too closely. Links \ud83c\udfa7 Podcast (Podbean): (add your episode link and I&rsquo;ll slot it in)\ud83d\udcac Discord: https://discord.gg/TwinCitiesByNight\ud83d\udcd8 Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/TwinCitiesByNight\ud83d\udc26 X (Twitter): https://x.com/Twin_Cities_VtM\ud83d\udc80 Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/TwinCitiesByNight </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Chronicles of Darkness: Inferno &quot;Temptation&quot; takes place in the year of our Lord 1425, nearly a year after the legendary undefeated Hussite general Jan \u017di\u017eka has succumbed to his wounds during the third anti-Hussite crusade. The crusade is over now and the Catholics were once again defeated but this is no time of peace. Famine and disease plague the land and war is on the horizon once again. During this time a small caravan of Hussites is moving towards a bastion of the Hussite faith - the city of T\u00e1bor. During their journey the caravan stop to rest near a burned down abbey...<br /> <br /> Inferno is a Chronicles of Darkness 1st edition expansion published by Onyx Path Publishing (Licensed from White Wolf Publishing).<br /> <br /> If you would like to support the podcast stop by our Patreon<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/TwinCitiesbyNight\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.patreon.com/TwinCitiesbyNight</a><br /> <br /> Come by and visit our Discord!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/T9zeN9p\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_co